<VI _name="Main.vi" description="Gold Hunter. Start: App_Init (queues, notifier), Game_Start (world, highscores), sprites, HUD and title pictures, Window_Setup, Audio_Start. Main (same as caller) holds the loops for keys (Key Down / Key Up by ScanCode and the Stop button -&gt; Key_Send -&gt; queue) and picture (Render_Frame in its own system -&gt; Screen). Game_Loop (standard: Engine_Tick 60 times per second, Frame_Pace) and Sound_Loop (other 2: Audio_Block) are subVIs with their own loop. Timing log of ticks and frames to Resources\Data, only when the cheat mode was used. Drag the window by its top border (mouse). End: Esc on the title screen, a click on the X at the top right of the screen, Stop, or Panel Close? (discarded) - the game ends normally, then Main closes its window. Keys: arrows = walk, climb, choose letters; Space = jump; Enter = start; Esc/P = pause; Z U L U = cheat (all rooms lit, endless lives).">
